%% title_en: api-sentinel — single owner of business policies
flowchart LR
    subgraph CALL[런타임 호출자 — 조회만]
        AC[api-account<br/>인증메일 · 카드 · 가입 rate limit<br/>OTP lockout · ACL · flag]
        BC["api-blockchain-supporter<br/>출금 화이트리스트(면제) · 국가/IP 제한"]
        AI["portal-ai<br/>에러 dedupe (rate limit)"]
        CS[portal-console<br/>Discord 답장 rate limit]
    end
    CON[portal-console · 백오피스<br/>ACL · flag · rate limit 정책 관리]
    subgraph SEN[api-sentinel ★]
        RT[런타임 gRPC 4종<br/>RateLimit · Lockout · ACL · FeatureFlag<br/>TryAcquire · RecordFailure · CheckBlocked · ExistsWhitelist · CheckEnabled]
        RF[rate limit · lockout 정책 refresher<br/>1분 ± 5초 jitter]
